        <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/geullah"/>
        <tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">(On Fast Days, the Chazzan says “Answer us” which is on page 000 and concludes, “Blessed are . . . Who responds at times of trouble.”)</tei:note>
        <j:declare xml:id="variants_5">
          <tei:fs type="opensiddur:variant">
            <tei:f name="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/refuah/chol_minchah_shemoneh_esreh">
